{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4XVHnbcHgKksiQKjj3","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at its center, shaped like an open mouth waiting to be fed.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*But which key? The door has no lock to parse — not yet. A key without specificity is just a piece of metal. The tumbler pins inside me do not recognize intent alone.*\n\n*I remain shut.*\n\n*Name the lock.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":112,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}